1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,653
You highlighted everything.

2
00:00:02,653 --> 00:00:04,164
Every page is yellow.

3
00:00:04,164 --> 00:00:05,468
You read it twice.

4
00:00:05,468 --> 00:00:08,900
So why, when the exam asks, does so little stick?

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,252
Three hundred pages.

6
00:00:15,252 --> 00:00:16,254
Four days left.

7
00:00:16,254 --> 00:00:17,820
Where do you even start?

8
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,167
Breathe.

9
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:22,362
Reading is not remembering.

10
00:00:22,362 --> 00:00:23,224
Recall is.

11
00:00:23,224 --> 00:00:24,400
Lumen has you.

12
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,578
Add a PDF or photos of your own notes.

13
00:00:30,578 --> 00:00:34,332
Lecture notes, handouts and books live in one calm library.

14
00:00:34,332 --> 00:00:36,960
Everything stays private, on your device.

15
00:00:50,283 --> 00:00:51,577
Read beside your tools.

16
00:00:51,577 --> 00:00:55,684
Highlight, write, add sticky notes and mark a region, right on the page.

17
00:00:55,684 --> 00:00:59,003
A lens follows your pointer when you need to read closely.

18
00:01:12,367 --> 00:01:13,789
Then the real learning.

19
00:01:13,789 --> 00:01:14,717
Hide the page.

20
00:01:14,717 --> 00:01:16,201
Explain it from memory.

21
00:01:16,201 --> 00:01:17,685
Reveal it, and compare.

22
00:01:17,685 --> 00:01:21,767
Think first, then reveal, with active recall and explain it back.

23
00:01:34,450 --> 00:01:36,219
Turn a moment into a recall card.

24
00:01:36,219 --> 00:01:38,686
Review timing adapts to how well you knew it.

25
00:01:38,686 --> 00:01:42,010
Your cards and practice lab wait for you in the study studio.

26
00:01:56,533 --> 00:01:59,358
Every highlight and note is gathered and searchable.

27
00:01:59,358 --> 00:02:04,953
Drag clinical stickers onto the page, and look up words with help in many languages, including Arabic.

28
00:02:18,617 --> 00:02:23,506
Twenty five minutes, one clear goal, soft sounds and short breaks.

29
00:02:23,506 --> 00:02:27,357
Daylight or evening, warm pages and your text size.

30
00:02:27,357 --> 00:02:29,357
Make yourself comfortable.

31
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:42,499
A five step learning loop.

32
00:02:42,499 --> 00:02:43,887
Six study methods.

33
00:02:43,887 --> 00:02:45,640
Zero automatic uploads.

34
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,936
Lumen is free to start.

35
00:02:51,936 --> 00:02:56,076
The full app comes with the Crown Pass, with seven days free.

36
00:02:56,076 --> 00:02:58,280
Turn your own notes into recall.
